# ============================================================
# Vajra — Monorepo environment templates
# ============================================================
# This repo uses per-package env files. Copy each template locally:
#
#   backend/.env.example  ->  backend/.env
#   frontend/.env.example ->  frontend/.env.local
#
# Never commit backend/.env or frontend/.env / .env.local
# Never put real database passwords or SMTP secrets in tracked files.
# ============================================================
